<title>SINGAPORE: Sunright says product transition hits net.</title>
<headline>Sunright says product transition hits net.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sunright Ltd said on Wednesday its net profit had dropped in the first half of its financial year because of a transition to new products in the testing business.</p>
<p>However, Sunright said in a statement issued with its results for the six months to January 31 that profits from its associates improved as a result of higher burn-in volume and a positive contribution from new testing business.</p>
<p>Sunright Ltd is an electronics company specialising in semiconductor testing.</p>
<p>-- Singapore enwsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
